OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of homes proposed for
OL,4,Acity green wedge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build hundreds of homes on
OL,7,Fgreen wedge land in Derby are set to be
OL,8,Fapproved, despite opposition.
OL,10,FUp to 350 homes are proposed to the
OL,11,Feast of Moorway Lane in Littleover, on
OL,12,Fthe protected Littleover and Sunnyhill
OL,13,Fgreen wedge, a planning designation
OL,14,Fdesigned to protect open areas of land
OL,15,Fbetween settlements.
OL,17,FObjection letters have been submitted
OL,18,Fby 220 residents, while a petition
OL,19,Flaunched by campaign group Greener
OL,20,FLittleover has been signed by 3,390
OL,21,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
